OL,3,GNEWSACrossCountry to provide full
OL,4,Aservice on Monday
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain operator CrossCountry will run a
OL,7,Ffull train service on Monday following
OL,8,Fmajor disruption to services across the
OL,9,Fcountry.
OL,11,FThe operator said it plans to run a
OL,12,F"very limited number of trains" from
OL,13,Faround 18:00 BST on Sunday evening, and
OL,14,Fa full service on Monday.
OL,16,FIt comes after a power outage affected
OL,17,Fits control centre in Birmingham,
OL,18,Fresulting in mass cancellations across
OL,19,Fthe network on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
